  "prefLabel": "Ncr 561.02 Fire Permit Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 561.02 Fire Permit Required. A fire permit shall be required for all open burning when the ground is not covered by snow. Should a question arise regarding the necessity of a fire permit for any burning device or container, the director shall make the final determination based upon analysis of the construction of the device and the ability or lack thereof of the device to transmit sparks or live fire brands which could endanger the woodlands.\n\nSource. #14243, INTERIM, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14452 (formerly Ncr 5601.02), eff 12-6-25, EXPIRES 12-6-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr520-590.html"
